TITLE Scenario 5516: pH=7.0, Medium, Humic=150mg/L, Sand, Wet, Ionic=Low
SOLUTION 1  RI contaminated soil pore water
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        3
    units     mol/L
    # Heavy metals
    Pb        4.8263e-04  # 100 mg/L
    Cu        1.2589e-03  # 80 mg/L
    Zn        1.8354e-03  # 120 mg/L
    Cd        7.1168e-05  # 8 mg/L
    # Competing cations
    Ca        2.4950e-03  # 100 mg/L
    Mg        2.0568e-03  # 50 mg/L
    # Ionic strength (salinity)
    Na        4.3497e-03  # 100 mg/L
    Cl        4.2313e-03  # 150 mg/L
    # Dissolved organic carbon
    C(4)      1.9826e-04  # 10 mg/L base DOC
    # Humic acid: 150 mg/L (as additional DOC)
    
SURFACE 1  Soil mineral surfaces (Fe/Al oxides)
    Hfo_wOH   0.1  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
